---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="搜索"><section class="page-heading"><div class="eyebrow">FIND A NOTE</div><h1>搜索文章</h1><p>输入关键词，查找标题与正文。</p></section><div id="search" class="search-container"></div><noscript><p>搜索需要启用 JavaScript。你也可以<a href="/archives/">通过归档查找文章</a>。</p></noscript><link href="/pagefind/pagefind-ui.css" rel="stylesheet" /><script is:inline src="/pagefind/pagefind-ui.js"></script><script is:inline>if (window.PagefindUI) { new PagefindUI({ element: '#search', showSubResults: true, translations: { placeholder: '搜索文章内容…', clear_search: '清除', load_more: '加载更多', search_label: '搜索文章', searching: '搜索中…', zero_results: '没有找到“[SEARCH_TERM]”的相关文章', many_results: '找到 [COUNT] 条结果', one_result: '找到 1 条结果' } }); }</script></Base>
